Subject: [PATCH] EXEC-MU-ACCOUNTS 3c check, lens guest: failing tests of the
 verified findings

- test_c3c_guest_recheck.py: a client-written X-Forwarded-For line chooses the visitor key (client_of reads the first
  line only); removing the test-account mark leaves the account's sessions working in pre-launch mode.
- test_c3c_guest_recheck_browser.py (Chromium, the built Terminal): a visitor's Terminal choice is uploaded into the
  account whose session ended on that browser; an indicator the guest plan no longer holds stays drawn; a visitor at
  its per-visitor quota is told to upgrade a plan.

